/obj/item/roguemachine/zadcote/merchant
	desc = "An Pharovian Trading Company zadcote. The brass plate reads ATC and a tally of late dispatches. The zads a canny invention of witch-engineering - product of the Eastern Grenz' lowlands. Artificed and Remade, these almost-avians are marketed from dedicated training grounds owned by the all-powerful VOC - or Vangedijk Oosten Compagnie - where elven and humen keepers raise zads and train them to navigate and home in. In the yil 1461, during the Blockade upon Carrio between the VOC and the Etruscan Trading Company, the Grenzelhoftan company attempted to use its newly trained zads to bombard the Etruscan ships. Unfortunately, most of the zads homed back onto the VOC ships, leading to the loss of at least four warships and a hundred men. Since this embarassment, the VOC has limited the usage of bomb zads to extreme circumstances."
